{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Approach, take, check properties, do specific task if object detected. Scan/move if not. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Action ID = MoveToNewPosition    /> <Action ID = StopMovement    />",
